#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hello World: Your First Quantum Circuit"
msgstr "Hello World: Tu Primer Circuito Cuántico"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"This "
"tutorial was created for doQumentation.\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"Este "
"tutorial fue creado para doQumentation.\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a [Bell state](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (two "
"entangled qubits) and run it three ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"Construye un [estado de Bell](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (dos"
" qubits entrelazados) y ejecútalo de tres maneras:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Ideal simulation** — perfect results, no account needed\n"
msgstr "**Simulación ideal** — resultados perfectos, sin cuenta necesaria\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Noisy simulation** — simulates a real device, no account needed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Simulación con ruido** — simula un dispositivo real, sin cuenta "
"necesaria\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Real quantum hardware** — requires a free IBM Quantum account (setup steps"
" below)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Hardware cuántico real** — requiere una cuenta de IBM Quantum gratuita "
"(pasos de configuración a continuación)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Build the circuit {#build-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Construir el circuito {#build-the-circuit}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Option 1: Ideal simulation (no account needed) {#option-1-ideal-simulation-"
"no-account-needed}"
msgstr ""
"Opción 1: Simulación ideal (sin cuenta necesaria) {#option-1-ideal-"
"simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Uses `StatevectorSampler` — a local simulator with perfect, noise-free "
"results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Usa `StatevectorSampler` — un simulador local con resultados perfectos, sin "
"ruido.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Option 2: Noisy simulation (no account needed) {#option-2-noisy-simulation-"
"no-account-needed}"
msgstr ""
"Opción 2: Simulación con ruido (sin cuenta necesaria) {#option-2-noisy-"
"simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Uses `FakeManilaV2` — a local simulator that mimics a real IBM quantum "
"device, including its noise characteristics. The circuit must first be "
"transpiled (adapted) to the device's gate set and qubit connectivity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Usa `FakeManilaV2` — un simulador local que imita un dispositivo cuántico "
"real de IBM, incluyendo sus características de ruido. El circuito debe "
"transpilarse primero (adaptarse) al conjunto de puertas y la conectividad de"
" qubits del dispositivo.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Option 3: Real quantum hardware {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"
msgstr "Opción 3: Hardware cuántico real {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requires a free IBM Quantum account. To set one up:\n"
msgstr "Requiere una cuenta de IBM Quantum gratuita. Para configurar una:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Register at "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration)"
" — no credit card required for the first 30 days\n"
msgstr ""
"Regístrate en "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration)"
" — no se requiere tarjeta de crédito durante los primeros 30 días\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sign in at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) and select"
" region **us-east** (required for the free Open Plan)\n"
msgstr ""
"Inicia sesión en [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) y "
"selecciona la región **us-east** (requerida para el Plan Abierto gratuito)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an instance (free Open Plan) at "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) if you don't have one "
"yet\n"
msgstr ""
"Crea una instancia (Plan Abierto gratuito) en "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) si aún no tienes una\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an API key at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) "
"(or at [cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"
msgstr ""
"Crea una clave de API en "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) (o en "
"[cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Copy your **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) from your "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page\n"
msgstr ""
"Copia tu **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) desde tu página de "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then, if you haven't saved your credentials yet in this Binder session, run "
"the cell below. Replace `<your-api-key>` with the API key from step 4, and "
"`<your-crn>` with the CRN from step 5.\n"
msgstr ""
"Luego, si aún no has guardado tus credenciales en esta sesión de Binder, "
"ejecuta la siguiente celda. Reemplaza `<your-api-key>` con la clave de API "
"del paso 4, y `<your-crn>` con el CRN del paso 5.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** Jobs on real hardware may take some time depending on queue times."
" If the cell is still running, you can check your job status and see the "
"results at "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nota:** Los trabajos en hardware real pueden tardar algún tiempo "
"dependiendo de los tiempos de cola. Si la celda aún se está ejecutando, "
"puedes verificar el estado de tu trabajo y ver los resultados en "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"

